{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1817","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. Entangled Substrings"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 mebibytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_channel"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"input"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"standard input"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_channel"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"output"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"standard output"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Quantum entanglement is when two particles link together in a certain way no matter how far apart they are in space."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a string $$$s$$$. A pair of its non-empty substrings $$$(a, b)$$$ is called "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"entangled"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if there is a (possibly empty) link string $$$c$$$ such that:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Every occurrence of $$$a$$$ in $$$s$$$ is immediately followed by $$$cb$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Every occurrence of $$$b$$$ in $$$s$$$ is immediately preceded by $$$ac$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In other words, $$$a$$$ and $$$b$$$ occur in $$$s$$$ only as substrings of $$$acb$$$. Compute the total number of entangled pairs of substrings of $$$s$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A string $$$a$$$ is a substring of a string $$$b$$$ if $$$a$$$ can be obtained from $$$b$$$ by the deletion of several (possibly zero or all) characters from the beginning and several (possibly zero or all) characters from the end."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first and only line contains a string $$$s$$$ of lowercase English letters ($$$1 \\leq |s| \\leq 10^5$$$) — the string for which you should count pairs of entangled substrings."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output a single integer, the number of entangled pairs of substrings of $$$s$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nabba\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nabacaba\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nabcabcabcabc\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nadamant\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n82\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example, the only entangled pair is ("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ab,ba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"). For this pair, the corresponding link string $$$c$$$ is empty, as they only occur as substrings of the whole string "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", which doesn't have any characters between "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ab"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example, there are no entangled pairs."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third example, the entangled pairs are ("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a,b"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"), ("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"b,c"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"), ("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a,c"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"), ("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a,bc"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"), and ("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ab,c"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"). For most pairs, the corresponding link string $$$c$$$ is empty, except for the pair ("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a,c"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"), for which the link string $$$c$$$ is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"b"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", as "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"c"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" only occur as substrings of the string "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abc"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"1817F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1817/problem/F"}